树枝上的布条，请将军过目。”说完，士兵将黑色布条举过头顶，恭敬的交给马背上的将军，然后退下“属下已经派人在这四周搜索，相信很快就会有结果。只是···。”“只是什么？”马背上的人不满的皱皱眉，口吻中带着强烈的不耐烦，握紧手中的黑色布条，眉宇间散发着浓浓戾气“说。”“是，此山名为白虎山，其实当地百姓都叫它苍狼山，因为这座山被狼群占有。”士兵小心翼翼的回答，用余光瞥了一眼地上的血迹，道“时至深秋。狼群都集中出来觅食，而刺客不仅身中剧毒，还受了很多的刀伤，身上的血腥味足以引来狼群，属下以为，那刺客怕是已经遭受狼群的攻击，尸骨无存了。”“尸骨无存？”马背上的人环顾了四周，刚刚来的时候隐约听见狼嚎，这样的说法不无可能。但是对手既然能够突破皇宫的重重把手，独自一人战胜数位高手，轻功十分了得，若不是身中剧毒，恐怕那九重皇宫，也不在话下吧。普天之下，能有这般能耐，除了当今皇上的两位兄长，还能有谁？但是谁都知道，如今安邦王紫胤远在千里之外对敌，另一个先王册封的逍遥王白千烨早在七年前当今皇上登基那日，废去王位，削筋断骨，武功全废，贬为庶民，至今生死未卜。这两个人都没有能力做到这般程度，那么还会有谁呢？皇上对这个刺客似乎感到恐惧，竟然吩咐了死要见尸活要见人。现如今似乎不太可能了“不要疏忽大意，仔细搜查，活要见人，死要见尸。”“是。属下遵命。”众人握拳，发出雄厚的声音。惊动了林中栖息鸟儿。当然，惊动的不仅是鸟儿。还有狼群。“这是···。”士兵全都集中在一块，盯着忽然窜出来的狼群，这已经不是十匹二十匹了，而是上百匹狼，个个垂涎三尺，步步紧逼。马不安的走动起来，有想要逃走的趋势，无奈被身上的人紧紧地束缚住，只能紧张的后退。“将军，属下来掩护，请将军快离开。”士兵个个义正言辞，挡在马的前面，准备拼死也要护住将军。“哼，我秦潇堂堂护国将军难道还敌不过这些畜生？”语毕，秦萧双脚一用力，整个人便腾空而起，快速的拔出腰间佩剑，剑身发出一声鹤鸣，尖锐刺耳齐琳向后看了看，刚刚听见了貌似鹤的叫声，但是这里是绝对不可能有鹤的。不管了，现在带着一个伤员，还不知道是福是祸，总之先回到狼穴再说。“嗷呜~”小白忽然放慢速度，颈圈的毛全部竖起来，这是它警戒时的表现。身边的狼也跟着警惕的看着四周。“怎么了？”齐琳知道如果不是十分紧急的情况，小白是不会发出这样的声音的。四周发出的响声也正预示着危险的到来，一股很不祥的感觉直冲脑门。“难道说···这里是北方狼群的势力范围么？”她怎么忘了？在北方居住着一群狼，虽然狼群散乱，数量却极多，虽然从未发生过冲突，但是却也危险。她们一直是在丛林边缘寻找食物，却因为这个人到了丛林里面，这样的话，刚好走到北方狼群的势力范围，该死，她怎么会这么大意，只想着避开人，没想到却落入狼口。齐琳仔细的观察着四周，依树而生的藤条倒是很多，也足够承受人的重量，要是她利用藤条，小白凭借自身的威慑力，一定能够顺利脱身，但是，现在它们多了一个伤员。齐琳自己要利用藤条离开都已经很困难了，更何况带上伤员。这下子，该怎么办才好？齐琳认真的皱起眉头，脑海中已经出现了几种逃脱方案，但是最好的都是丢掉这个捡来的伤员，齐琳不是没想过，一来不知道这个人是好是坏，要是醒来反咬自己一口怎么办？二来，她与此人非亲非故，救，只是出于好心，不救，也是天经地义。黑衣人的手指微微动了动，眼睛微睁，长长的睫毛被露水打湿，看上去更加深邃。微微动了动身子，忽觉心口一阵剧痛，还好他承受力极强，只是小心的呼吸了一下。当然，他也注意到了周围的不妙。甚至已经看到了草丛中带着杀气的眸子，只是在等待时机攻击罢了。“小白，沉住气。”齐琳并不知道身前的人已经恢复意识，最终她还是没有办法丢下这个人自己离去。所以现在就是要比谁沉得住气，小白的威慑力不是一般的强大，只要不轻举妄动，应该可以拖延一点时间的。黑衣人微微一愣，他明显的感觉到了齐琳颤抖的身体，但是听着齐琳说出来的话，却是心平气和，毫不畏惧。这个女人···内心是多强大？正想要继续静观其变，忽然感觉旁边有异动，黑衣人敏锐的一瞥，那里正藏着十来匹狼，已经做好了攻击的准备。等不下去了。“啊”齐琳忽觉腰间一紧，身子一轻，整个人就被带离了地面，回过神来的时候她已经被带到了大树上。小白它们也已经开始对抗对手，正很顺利的拜托狼群，只是一些狼比较弱，被围着，但是小白都没有放弃任何，掩护它们。齐琳这才松一口气。“没想到你竟然担心狼群，而不考虑自己的安危。”黑衣人隔着蒙面淡淡的说道，经过刚刚的发力，额头上已经布满了层层细汗，若不是看准了这棵树够大，他实在没有办法带着齐琳到远一点的树上。现在他必须屏气凝神，调息一下。齐琳转头看着黑衣人，正瞧见他闭上眼睛，想来他是受了重伤，正在调息，而树下的狼已经开始聚集，看来是打算将他们困在这里了。稳住呼吸，齐琳开口道“现在，我该担心的就只是自己了。”黑衣人睁开眼睛，看着齐琳如墨的双眸，明明已经害怕到发冷汗，却能够掩饰的如此之好，真是奇怪的女人“只是你？”“难道你自己脱身很难么？”齐琳知道黑衣人自己飞身离去是极有可能的，她没有理由叫黑衣人考虑自己的安全“看你的样子，不只是受伤那么简单。你中毒了？”黑衣人看着齐琳，像是询问，却说得毫无感情，只是表面上的客套话罢了。其实齐琳是因为太紧张了，这才寻找话题的。但是对方似乎并不搭理，她也没有问下去的冲动，俗话说，知道的越多，死的越早，她现在还不想死。虽然一直待在这上面是安全的，但是这样的狼群很容易引来刚刚的那些人，说不定会被牵连进去。而且···这棵树也不是绝对安全，到了晚上，蛇虫鼠蚁便会将他们瓜分。怎么都不是办法，小白它们也不一定能够前来支援。当下只能凭借这些藤条慢慢的离开了。“那些人不会来。”看出齐琳的担忧，黑衣人淡淡的说道“你自己可以借着这些藤条离开。”齐琳无语的看着黑衣人，她是很想借着这些藤条离开啊，非常想，从一开始就想着了，但是“你以为每个人都和你一样可以模仿蜘蛛侠么？”“蜘蛛侠？”黑衣人疑惑的看着齐琳，仔细的推敲齐琳的言中之意“没什么。”意识到自己说错话，齐琳也懒得去解释，天色渐晚，天空已经出现星星。黑衣人也没有想要自己离开的意思，齐琳索性一屁股坐在树干上，黑衣人也随她坐下。齐琳取下身上的包裹，这是她自己摘的野果子，同时也收集了一些驱赶虫类的果实。齐琳拿出一些，小心翼翼的将果汁涂在接近他们的树干上，这样至少可以避免一些不必要的麻烦，这才取出可以吃的果子，想了一下，递给了黑衣人一个“这黑灯瞎火的也看不清是什么，毒死了也不关我的事。”齐琳只听见黑衣人轻哼一声，手中的果子便被接了过去，随后便是牙齿咬碎果子发出的清脆的响声，知道黑衣人已经吃了，她自己也拿出一个，张口就咬。可是才刚咬下第一口，就酸的齐琳皱起了眉头。“呸呸呸。”齐琳吐掉口中的残渣，开始怀疑自己是不是采到什么山楂了，刚想要丢掉手中的果子，却被旁边的人一把抢了过去，随后便听见一声清脆，齐琳只觉一股清口水直往外冒，她还是咽了下去“你若是饿了，我这里还有，那个是我吃过的，而且··还很酸。”“呵呵，无妨。”黑衣人咽下最后一口果子，只觉得体内有一股力量正从丹田往上直冲脑门，手脚的麻木感也渐渐的消失。真是因祸得福，没想到自己身上的毒液竟会被这野果解去。才吃第一个果子的时候，那股奇酸就已经令他难忍，可是咽下第一口，却觉得体内有一股力量正在冲出来，稍微运气，才发现经脉正在逐一被打通。没想到他自己制造的能解百毒的丹药都无法解除的毒，竟会被一个野果子解去，他当然不会介意了。接下来，齐琳和黑衣人都没有对话，两个人沉默着，树底下的狼依旧存在，只是天上的星星越来越多，气温开始骤降，齐琳倒是觉得发冷，身上的兽皮本来就少，这下子更加的冷了，平时都是呆在洞里，依偎在小白的身上取暖。齐琳双臂环抱，缩成一团，却不靠向旁边半分。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/meirenzhiqibutianxia/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2 In Distress Not long after Qi Lin and the others left, more than a dozen soldiers wearing armor rushed over. The romance time travel book is updated for the first time. You can only come to 151+Kanshu.com to carefully look at the blood-stained grass. \"General, there is the most blood here. It seems that there was a struggle, but there is no sign of the assassin. I only found a piece of cloth hanging on a branch. Please take a look at it, General.\" After saying that, the soldier raised the black piece of cloth above his head and handed it to the general on horseback respectfully. Then he stepped back. \"My subordinate has already We have sent people to search around, and I believe there will be results soon...\" \"Just what?\" The man on the horse frowned with strong impatience, holding the black cloth in his hand, and said with a strong look on his face. \"Yes, this is it. The name of the mountain is Baihu Mountain. In fact, the local people call it Canglang Mountain because the mountain is occupied by wolves.\" The soldier replied cautiously, glancing at the blood on the ground with his peripheral vision, and said, \"It is late autumn when the wolves gather together to look for food, and the assassin is not only severely poisoned, but also suffered a lot. The many stab wounds and the smell of blood on his body were enough to attract the wolves. The subordinates thought that the assassin had been attacked by the wolves and his body was gone. \"The man on horseback looked around and heard the howling of wolves when he just arrived. This is not impossible.\" But since the opponent was able to break through the palace's heavy handles and defeat several masters alone, his lightness skills were very impressive. If he hadn't been poisoned, he might not have been able to defeat the Nine Levels Palace. In the whole world, who else can have such ability except the two brothers of the current emperor? But everyone knows that Anbang King Ziyin is now thousands of miles away from the enemy. Another Xiaoyao King Bai Qianye, who was canonized by the previous king, deposed the throne seven years ago on the day when the current emperor ascended the throne. His muscles and bones were cut, his martial arts skills were completely useless, and he was demoted to a commoner. His life and death are still uncertain. Neither of these two people have the ability to do this, so who else can? The emperor seemed to be afraid of this assassin, and actually ordered him to see his corpse or live in person. It seems impossible now. \"Don't be careless, search carefully, you want to see the person alive, and the corpse if you are dead.\" \"Yes. I obey the order.\" Everyone clenched their fists and made a strong voice. It startled the birds that roosted in the forest. Of course, it wasn't just the birds that were alarmed. And there are wolves. \"This is...\" The soldiers all gathered together, staring at the pack of wolves that suddenly sprang out. They were no longer ten or twenty, but hundreds of wolves, all of them salivating and pressing forward step by step. The horse started to move uneasily, with a tendency to want to escape, but was helplessly restrained by the person on it, so it could only retreat nervously. \"General, my subordinates are here to take cover. General, please leave quickly.\" The soldiers all spoke uprightly and stood in front of the horses, prepared to risk their lives to protect the general. \"Hmph, I, Qin Xiao, the dignified general who protects the country, can't stand up to these beasts?\" After saying this, Qin Xiao pushed his feet hard, and he rose into the air. He quickly pulled out the sword at his waist. The sword made a crane cry, which was sharp and piercing. Qi Lin looked back. She just heard what sounded like a crane's cry, but there was absolutely no way there was a crane here. No matter, now that I am carrying a wounded person, I don’t know whether it is a blessing or a curse. Anyway, we will go back to the wolf’s den first. \"Ouch~\" Xiaobai suddenly slowed down and all the hair on his collar stood up. This was his sign of alertness. The wolf next to him also looked around cautiously. \"What's wrong?\" Qi Lin knew that Xiaobai would not make such a sound if it was not a very urgent situation. The noises all around heralded the coming danger, and an ominous feeling rushed directly to my head. \"Could it be that...this is the sphere of influence of the northern wolves?\" How could she forget? There is a group of wolves living in the north. Although the wolves are scattered, they are extremely numerous. Although there has never been any conflict, they are also dangerous. They had been looking for food at the edge of the jungle, but because of this man they entered the jungle. In this case, they were just within the sphere of influence of the northern wolves. Damn it, how could she be so careless and just wanted to avoid people, but unexpectedly she fell into the wolf's mouth. Qi Lin carefully observed the surroundings. There were many rattans growing on the trees, which were enough to bear the weight of a person. If she used the rattans, Xiaobai would be able to escape smoothly with her own deterrence. However, now they have one more injured person. It was already difficult for Qi Lin to use the cane to leave, let alone bring the wounded. What should I do now? Qi Lin frowned seriously. Several escape plans had appeared in her mind, but the best one was to throw away the injured person she picked up. Didn't Qi Lin never think about it? She didn't know whether this person was good or bad. What if he wakes up and bites her back? Secondly, she was not related to this person, so saving him was just out of good intentions, and not saving him was completely justified. The man in black moved his fingers slightly, opened his eyes slightly, and his long eyelashes were wet with dew, making them look even deeper. He moved slightly, and suddenly felt a sharp pain in his heart. Fortunately, he could bear it very well, so he just breathed carefully. Of course, he also noticed something bad around him. He even saw murderous eyes in the grass, just waiting for the opportunity to attack. \"Xiao Bai, calm down.\" Qi Lin didn't know that the person in front of her had regained consciousness. In the end, she still couldn't leave him alone. So now it's a matter of who can keep his composure. Xiaobai's deterrence is not that powerful. As long as he doesn't act rashly, he should be able to delay it for a while. The man in black was slightly startled. He could clearly feel Qi Lin's trembling body, but when he heard what Qi Lin said, he was calm and unafraid. This woman...how strong is her heart? Just as he was about to continue to watch the changes, he suddenly felt something moving next to him. The man in black took a sharp glance and saw that there were about ten wolves hiding there, ready to attack. Can't wait any longer. \"", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}